#ASSERT `Did the sponsor report in time` TRUE `a malfunction or deterioration of the device` FALSE (`the date` 2 7 2025) 10 FALSE (`the date` 1 1 2000) (`the date` 1 11 2026) EQUALS `there is no such duty on these facts`

