§ `Must the hospital report what happened to me (s 41JM)`

-- Before 22 March 2023 the duty did not exist; 22 March 2023 to 20 March 2025 cannot be told; from 21 March 2025 it did.
#ASSERT `Must the hospital report what happened to me` (`the date` 21 3 2023) `a public hospital` TRUE `the device was used on me there and caused my death or a serious deterioration in my health` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must the hospital report what happened to me` (`the date` 22 3 2023) `a public hospital` TRUE `the device was used on me there and caused my death or a serious deterioration in my health` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Must the hospital report what happened to me` (`the date` 20 3 2025) `a public hospital` TRUE `the device was used on me there and caused my death or a serious deterioration in my health` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Must the hospital report what happened to me` (`the date` 21 3 2025) `a public hospital` TRUE `the device was used on me there and caused my death or a serious deterioration in my health` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 41JM(4): treated in a private hospital for the deterioration.
#ASSERT `Must the hospital report what happened to me` (`the date` 1 6 2026) `a private hospital` TRUE `I was treated there for a serious deterioration in my health caused by the device` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 41JM(3): someone stopped its use.
#ASSERT `Must the hospital report what happened to me` (`the date` 1 6 2026) `a public hospital` TRUE `someone there stopped the device being used, and its use would have caused death or a serious deterioration` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not a healthcare facility; not a reportable device; nothing that s 41JM(2)-(4) covers; s 41JM(7) already reported.
#ASSERT `Must the hospital report what happened to me` (`the date` 1 6 2026) `none of these (for example a clinic that is not prescribed)` TRUE `I was treated there for a serious deterioration in my health caused by the device` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must the hospital report what happened to me` (`the date` 1 6 2026) `a public hospital` FALSE `I was treated there for a serious deterioration in my health caused by the device` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must the hospital report what happened to me` (`the date` 1 6 2026) `a public hospital` TRUE `none of these` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must the hospital report what happened to me` (`the date` 1 6 2026) `a public hospital` TRUE `I was treated there for a serious deterioration in my health caused by the device` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Was the supply to me notified in time (s 41HC(6B))`

-- Supplied Saturday 1 March 2025: 28 days end Saturday 29 March, moved to Monday 31 March 2025.
#ASSERT `Was the supply to me notified in time` TRUE (`the date` 1 3 2025) TRUE (`the date` 31 3 2025) (`the date` 1 11 2026) EQUALS `done in time`
#ASSERT `Was the supply to me notified in time` TRUE (`the date` 1 3 2025) TRUE (`the date` 1 4 2025) (`the date` 1 11 2026) EQUALS `not done in time`
-- Supplied Monday 3 March 2025: the last day is Monday 31 March 2025.
#ASSERT `Was the supply to me notified in time` TRUE (`the date` 3 3 2025) TRUE (`the date` 31 3 2025) (`the date` 1 11 2026) EQUALS `done in time`
#ASSERT `Was the supply to me notified in time` TRUE (`the date` 3 3 2025) TRUE (`the date` 1 4 2025) (`the date` 1 11 2026) EQUALS `not done in time`
-- Not yet notified.
