#ASSERT `Was the supply to me notified in time` TRUE (`the date` 3 3 2025) FALSE (`the date` 1 1 2000) (`the date` 31 3 2025) EQUALS `still open until` (`the date` 31 3 2025)
#ASSERT `Was the supply to me notified in time` TRUE (`the date` 3 3 2025) FALSE (`the date` 1 1 2000) (`the date` 1 4 2025) EQUALS `not done in time`
